{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407/events","html_url":"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407","id":113940168,"node_id":"MDU6SXNzdWUxMTM5NDAxNjg=","number":2407,"title":"`PatternUtils.formatPattern` replaces encoded space (%20) with +","user":{"login":"coopy","id":794843,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NDg0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/794843?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy","html_url":"https://github.com/coopy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/coopy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":100166615,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMDAxNjY2MTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"F44250","default":true,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/milestones/6","html_url":"https://github.com/remix-run/react-router/milestone/6","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/milestones/6/labels","id":1379688,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTM3OTY4OA==","number":6,"title":"v1.0.0-final","description":"","creator":{"login":"taion","id":3112159,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMTIxNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3112159?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion","html_url":"https://github.com/taion","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/taion/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":19,"state":"closed","created_at":"2015-10-27T15:54:37Z","updated_at":"2015-11-10T03:50:51Z","due_on":"2015-11-06T05:00:00Z","closed_at":"2015-11-10T03:50:51Z"},"comments":8,"created_at":"2015-10-28T22:33:25Z","updated_at":"2019-01-22T14:52:58Z","closed_at":"2015-10-30T20:47:47Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":"resolved","sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"This line causes a URL parameter to be encoded in a non-reversible way: https://github.com/rackt/react-router/blob/v1.0.0-rc3/modules/PatternUtils.js#L170\n\nWe have an IIS server that doesn't correctly resolve URLs because of this behavior.\n\nThe change was introduced here: https://github.com/rackt/react-router/commit/d955d7a69052fd649b58d00bd75301a533f67e06\n\nI'd like to know the reason that this behavior was introduced, as it's somewhat unexpected. To quote @mjackson:\n\n> Apparently + is a special character in query strings, but not in the path portion of the URL. \n> https://github.com/rackt/react-router/issues/716#issuecomment-71346876\n\nI've not been able to find conclusive evidence in the [URI spec](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3986), but considering that encoding and decoding should be symmetrical operations, this seems wrong. There is some discussion in this [Stackoverflow thread](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/2678551/when-to-encode-space-to-plus-or-20).\n\nExample:\n\n```\nvar placeName = 'Laguna Beach';\nvar uri = formatPattern('/place/:placeName', { placeName: placeName });\ndecodeURI(uri);\n// -> \"/place/Laguna+Beach\"\n// Expected decoded URI would be \"/place/Laguna Beach\".\n```\n","closed_by":{"login":"mjackson","id":92839,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/92839?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson","html_url":"https://github.com/mjackson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mjackson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/remix-run/react-router/issues/2407/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}